# Runnable examples for the order service (docs/API.md has the full contract).
#
# Pick the target by changing @host:
#   Docker (docker compose up --build), through nginx:  http://localhost:8080
#   Docker, API container directly:                      http://localhost:5080
#   Local dev (dotnet run, http profile):                http://localhost:5158
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health (API + database)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Menu: sizes, topping categories, per-size topping prices
GET {{host}}/api/menu
Accept: application/json

### Quote: the API contract's worked example → total 31.23
POST {{host}}/api/orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "large", "toppingCodes": ["pepperoni", "bacon"], "quantity": 2 } ],
  "promoCode": "ILOVEPIZZA",
  "tip": { "mode": "percent", "value": "15" }
}

### Quote: SAVE5 on an order that isn't over $20 → 400 with a field error
POST {{host}}/api/orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "small", "toppingCodes": [], "quantity": 2 } ],
  "promoCode": "SAVE5",
  "tip": { "mode": "amount", "value": "2.50" }
}

### Submit: 201 + Location + ETag. Send it again with the SAME key → 200 and the same order (safe retry).
# Change the key to place another order. expectedTotal must equal the quote's total (else 409 price.changed).
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2b7e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "large", "toppingCodes": ["pepperoni", "bacon"], "quantity": 2 } ],
  "promoCode": "ILOVEPIZZA",
  "tip": { "mode": "percent", "value": "15" },
  "expectedTotal": 31.23
}

### For the requests below: paste the id from the submit response (or follow its Location header)
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get the order and its status (the ETag header is its version)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Update while NotStarted: If-Match must be the ETag from GET (stale → 412; started → 409)
PUT {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "<etag from GET>"

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "large", "toppingCodes": ["pepperoni", "bacon"], "quantity": 1 } ],
  "promoCode": null,
  "tip": { "mode": "amount", "value": "2.00" },
  "expectedTotal": 17.21
}

### Kitchen: advance to the next status (NotStarted → Started → ReadyForPickup → Delivered)
POST {{host}}/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/advance

### Cancel = delete, only while NotStarted (204; then 404. After the kitchen starts → 409)
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### OpenAPI document (Development only: local dev on 5158)
GET http://localhost:5158/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
